    "created_at": "2016-09-25T08:36:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-25T08:36:18Z",
    "body": "Currently Edge and Safari allow user to enter fullscreen regardless of whether it is allowed by DOM. Firefox is... something in-between, which doesn't make much sense. We want to align to one or the other.\n\nI personally think disallowing it even via browser UI is safer (less troublesome), while @smaug---- thinks we should allow user to do what they want.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
