    "created_at": "2016-09-26T14:12:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T14:12:37Z",
    "body": "The specification can encourage one way or another, but we can't require anything here I think, although I guess we should say what happens with respect to events if an implementation allows it.\n",
